.TH "nvme_init_set_features_fdp_events" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_fdp_events" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_fdp_events \- Initialize passthru command for Flexible Data Placement Events
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_fdp_events
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u16 phndl "  ","
.BI "bool fdpee "  ","
.BI "__u8 *event_types "  ","
.BI "__u8 noet "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "phndl" 12
Placement Handle (PHNDL)
.IP "fdpee" 12
FDP Event Enable (FDPEE)
.IP "event_types" 12
FDP Event Type List data buffer, see Figure 504 of the Base
Specification
.IP "noet" 12
Number of FDP Event Types (NOET) contained in \fIevent_types\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_FDP_EVENTS
